    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736100/extras/b6fa587e21cfb35596ee9763cafbe6d8.avif?t=1706218947\" width=457 height=203 /></span><br><br>Lost in the Past: A Heart's Remembrance Labyrinth is a story game about love, lost, hope, grief, medication, meditation and more.<br>You will be the our nameless character and experience his memories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736100/extras/b93bbe1411917596968c064ea55e5063.poster.avif?t=1706218947\" width=550 height=415 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736100/extras/b93bbe1411917596968c064ea55e5063.webm?t=1706218947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>All starts with a lost and gears of cosmos stucks.<br>Loose part, broken parts...<br>Living becomes a turmoil.<br><br>Our nameless character needs to find a way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736100/extras/15a8e9ae8330c44809bb5cb636cbd4f3.avif?t=1706218947\" width=457 height=247 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Different Styles of Colorfull Illustration</strong><br>Illustration styles will change through the story accourding to reflect that scene<br></li><li><strong>Different Gameplays</strong><br>Sometimes it will be a click and point, sometimes a simple puzzle or a platformer<br></li><li><strong>Lovely and Immersive Musics</strong><br>Musics will help to set the mood.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736100/extras/7a5a9a5dc3ff36fd9ce5458636de92dd.poster.a